{"seq":2,"slug":"errors-agents-can-act-on","title":"Errors Agents Can Act On","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/observability-and-errors-for-agents/errors-agents-can-act-on","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"clear-actionable-errors","title":"清晰、可操作的错误","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/observability-and-errors-for-agents/errors-agents-can-act-on/clear-actionable-errors","wordCount":1576,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"structured-and-typed-errors","title":"结构化与带类型的错误","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/observability-and-errors-for-agents/errors-agents-can-act-on/structured-and-typed-errors","wordCount":1657,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"failing-loudly-not-silently","title":"要响亮地失败而非静默","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/observability-and-errors-for-agents/errors-agents-can-act-on/failing-loudly-not-silently","wordCount":1755,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<p>本章讲怎么让错误成为 agent 真能据以行动的东西,而非一团没法用的噪音。清晰、可操作的错误:说清在哪(文件/行/位置)、什么错、为什么、尽量给纠正方向——&quot;期望 X 得到 Y&quot;远胜&quot;invalid&quot;,让 agent 一读就能定位和修。结构化与带类型的错误:用带类型、带结构的错误(错误码、错误类型、字段)而非一句裸字符串,让 agent(和代码)能可靠地区分是什么错、据此分别处理,而非靠字符串匹配去猜。要响亮地失败而非静默:出了错就明确地以非零退出码、抛出、报错失败,绝不吞掉错误假装成功——静默失败让 agent 以为没事、压根不去纠错,是最危险的反模式。</p>\n"}